# Orders ACL: Create=role:any; Read/Update/Delete=specific admin user/team only.
# With direct anonymous checkout, disable Orders row-level security and use table ACL.
# Products: permit public Read; restrict all write access to the authenticated admin/team.
# Storage: permit public file Read for product photos; restrict file writes to the admin/team.
